# MergeReady

Evidence-backed reports showing where pull requests lose time and what is slowing delivery.

MergeReady helps teams understand where changes wait between pull request opening and production. It aims to identify measurable flow and coordination signals, link each finding to evidence, and suggest a practical next action.

## First prototype

The initial version will read GitHub pull request and CI information, calculate a small set of transparent delivery-flow metrics, and produce a concise report. It will be read-only: it will not post comments or change repository settings.

## Development

Create and activate a virtual environment, install the project with `python3 -m pip install -e .`, then run `mergeready --help`.

## Status

Early prototype, built for Fly.io Hacksgiving 2026.
